  <!-- CE 下斗牛犬霰弹型改为 KS-23，与 1.7 的翻译同名，开 CE 时取代它（语言档依相对路径去重，CE 资料夹先载入）。Under CE the bullhound shotgun becomes a KS-23; shares the 1.7 file name so it replaces that translation (language files dedupe by relative path and 1.7/CE loads first). -->
  <!-- EN: mounted KS-23 -->
  <DMS_BullHound_ShotgunMounted.label>挂载式 KS-23</DMS_BullHound_ShotgunMounted.label>
  <!-- EN: A KS-23 carbine shotgun fixed to a bullhound's back mount. Its 23x75mmR shells are built to stop intruders in corridors and doorways outright.

This weapon is designed specifically for mounted use, so only specific units can equip it. -->
  <DMS_BullHound_ShotgunMounted.description>固定在斗牛犬背部挂架上的 KS-23 卡宾霰弹枪。它的 23x75mmR 弹药是为了在走廊与门口把入侵者当场放倒而生的。

这种武器是专门为固定挂载设计的，因此只有特定的单位能够装备。</DMS_BullHound_ShotgunMounted.description>

</LanguageData>
